{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557380/extras/steam-preGIF3.gif?t=1749545970\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Cake UP, you will play as a cake courier who delivers an order to the king, in the midst of a magical war. He finds himself on a fierce battlefield of two magicians who do not pay attention to a small courier. The poor guy is trying to get around obstacles and bandits, and he's also worried about the safety of the cake, otherwise the customer will be furious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The player tries on the role of a courier who wants to do his job during the battle of two magicians.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>GAME FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deliver the order to the final destination.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dodge the spells that threaten you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Various types of spells flying around the arena, which you will have to deftly avoid.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dropped a piece of cake? Get up off the ground! No one has canceled the five-second rule!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect the cupcakes scattered on each level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dodge all the spells and collect all the cupcakes to get the highest score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock levels as you progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight unique bosses at the end of each location.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3557380?t=1749545970","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557380/aef7d2d18b0a7efea90428f9d45913e996961b10/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749545970","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557380/a20a1b1af2ad01f1ed500336059abe535b967db5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749545970","